---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { RESUME_PDF } from '../../consts';
import { withBase } from '../../lib/url';

const pdfHref = withBase(RESUME_PDF);
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Resume"
  description="Tien Nguyen - AI Product Manager / Lead AI Technical Product Owner. Enterprise agentic operations."
>
  <section class="page-head section resume-actions">
    <p class="eyebrow">Resume</p>
    <h1>Tien Nguyen</h1>
    <p class="lead">AI Product Manager / Lead AI Technical Product Owner</p>
    <div class="action-row">
      <a class="button" href={pdfHref} data-astro-reload download="Tien-Nguyen-CV.pdf"
        >Download PDF</a
      >
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section resume-sheet" data-pagefind-body>
    <p class="resume-contact">
      Ho Chi Minh City ·
      <a href="mailto:tiennguyentthao@gmail.com">tiennguyentthao@gmail.com</a>
      ·
      <a href="tel:+84963351586">+84 963 351 586</a>
      ·
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/tiennguyenthithao/">LinkedIn</a>
      ·
      <a href="https://tiennguyentt.github.io/">tiennguyentt.github.io</a>
    </p>

    <h2>Summary</h2>
    <p class="resume-lead">
      AI Product Manager and Lead AI Technical Product Owner for enterprise agentic operations. I
      design and lead platforms that turn complex workflows into governed business operations across
      AI, knowledge, orchestration, evaluation, and governance. Operating loop: Observe, Detect,
      Explain, Recommend, Approve, Execute, Verify, Learn. Stack includes RAG, ReAct agents,
      multi-agent orchestration, human-in-the-loop controls, runtime checks, and evidence-based
      verification. Seven years shipping B2B fintech, payments, transportation, and enterprise
      systems from 0-to-1 through high-scale operations.
    </p>

    <h2>Experience</h2>
    <article class="resume-job">
      <h3>GSM - Green SM - Technical PO | Agent Orchestration &amp; Harness Engineering</h3>
      <p class="resume-job__meta">
        Agentic Ops Platform · Applied AI · Full-time · Jul 2026-Present
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Own product for an enterprise Agentic Ops Platform: advisory-first control plane that
          observes fleet signals, detects anomalies, recommends actions, and executes only after
          policy checks and human approval.
        </li>
        <li>
          Spec shared AI platform services used across products: model gateway with fail-closed data
          classification, RAG/embeddings, and knowledge-graph tools with an auditable decision log.
        </li>
        <li>
          Define agent release and ops loops: agentic SDLC with gated remediation, simulation/replay
          before policy or model changes, and an ops console for exceptions, capacity, and decision
          history.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="resume-job">
      <h3>Colonial Surety Company - PE</h3>
      <p class="resume-job__meta">
        B2B fintech, insurance, payments · Contract · Feb 2026-Jul 2026
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Ran an agent-operated PM workflow: graded transcripts for traceability, linked specs to
          sources, and blocked changes that lacked sign-off inside a regulated US insurer.
        </li>
        <li>
          Led an emergency PCI payment cutover from Transax to CardPointe across three live
          platforms after the primary gateway shut down.
        </li>
        <li>
          Designed seven insurance products in one flow (knockout rules, shared claims,
          partial-failure cases). Wrote the B2B SSO BRD for two user types and partner sessions.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="resume-job">
      <h3>Hoookie - PM</h3>
      <p class="resume-job__meta">Web3 and fintech · Full-time · Vietnam · 2023-2026</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Led requirements for a US payments network targeting 400 ms cross-chain settlement,
          including a non-custodial wallet with KYC/AML and fiat-to-crypto bridging.
        </li>
        <li>
          Owned roadmap, backlog, and Scrum for an autonomous on-chain prediction-market fund. A
          two-month backtest returned 137% ($10K to $23.7K) with model scoring before release.
        </li>
        <li>
          Shipped aVault and aLink (USDC strategies, token-gated mispricing terminal, Telegram
          toolkit). Built the fund loop: score edge, cap risk, paper-trade, then settle scores.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="resume-job">
      <h3>Olmo Technology - PO</h3>
      <p class="resume-job__meta">Social e-commerce · Full-time · 2022-2023</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Raised bookings 30% by reworking mobile booking and cutting payment time. Shipped
          livestream gifting and live-booking.
        </li>
        <li>
          Led a 12-person Scrum team that launched a livestream app in 6 months and an e-commerce
          platform in 4 months. Personas, backlog, and stories raised sprint delivery speed 20%.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="resume-job">
      <h3>4/10 Fire Protection Trading Service - APM</h3>
      <p class="resume-job__meta">ERP · Full-time · 2019-2022</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Built front-end ERP modules for 6 months, then moved from full-stack engineering into BA
          and Associate Product Manager ownership of resource management and quality control.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <h2>Skills</h2>
    <ul class="resume-skills-list">
      <li>
        <strong>AI systems:</strong> RAG, ReAct agents, multi-agent orchestration, persistent memory,
        runtime controls
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Governance:</strong> human-in-the-loop, evaluation thresholds, evidence checks, decision
        logs
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Product:</strong> roadmap, backlog, Scrum, BRD, SRS, PRD, acceptance checks, stakeholder
        workshops
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Domains:</strong> B2B fintech, insurance, payments, enterprise operations
      </li>
      <li><strong>Delivery:</strong> pilots, integrations, production rollout, PCI cutovers</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Projects</h2>
    <ul class="resume-demos">
      <li>
        <strong>Gelato.</strong> Agent-tool framework for company operations: orchestration, gates, decision
        logs. In progress.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Knowledge Engine.</strong> Meeting notes to sourced wiki; conflict flags; graded specs;
        human sign-off before engineering.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Recon.</strong> Daily research sweeps scored for relevance, credibility, and predictive
        weight.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Education</h2>
    <ul class="resume-skills-list">
      <li>Anthropic Claude Code and Agent Skills - 2026</li>
      <li>Product School AI Product Certification - 2025</li>
      <li>CoderSchool Full Stack Developer - 2019</li>
      <li>HCMC University of Education, BA English - 2014</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .resume-actions.page-head {
    padding-block: clamp(1.15rem, 3vw, 1.85rem) 0.65rem;
  }

  .resume-actions h1 {
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3.6vw, 2.25rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1.08;
  }

  .resume-actions .lead {
    font-size: 1.02rem;
  }

  .resume-actions .action-row {
    margin-top: 0.85rem;
  }

  .resume-sheet.section {
    max-width: 40rem;
    padding-top: 1.15rem;
    padding-bottom: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  }

  .resume-contact {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.7rem;
    border-bottom: var(--hairline);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .resume-lead {
    margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .resume-sheet h2 {
    margin: 1.35rem 0 0.45rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    line-height: 1.2;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .resume-job {
    margin: 0 0 1.15rem;
    padding-top: 0.7rem;
    border-top: var(--hairline);
  }

  .resume-job:first-of-type {
    padding-top: 0;
    border-top: 0;
  }

  .resume-job h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .resume-job__meta {
    margin: 0.2rem 0 0.4rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .resume-job ul,
  .resume-demos,
  .resume-skills-list {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .resume-job li,
  .resume-demos li,
  .resume-skills-list li {
    margin: 0.32rem 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .resume-demos,
  .resume-skills-list {
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .resume-demos strong,
  .resume-skills-list strong {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
</style>
